{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36913","headline":"送{巩/言}光大师 · 罗隐","name":"送{巩/言}光大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禹祠分首戴湾逢，健笔寻知达九重。\n圣主赐衣怜绝艺，侍臣摛藻许高踪。\n宁亲久别街西寺，待诏初离海上峰。\n一种苦心师得了，不须回首笑龙锺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}